# 6. Functional Requirements

## Authentication

Users can

* Register
* Login
* Logout

JWT should protect all private routes.

---

## Dashboard

Dashboard contains

### Statistics Cards

* Total Movies
* Total Books
* Average Rating
* Favorites

---

### Charts

Movies vs Books

Genre Distribution

Rating Distribution

---

### Recent Movies

Display recently added movies only.

---

### Recent Books

Display recently added books only.

Movies and Books must NEVER be mixed.

---

## Library

The Library page contains two completely separate sections.

### Movies

Movie cards only.

### Books

Book cards only.

Movies must always appear above Books.

---

## Add Item

The user selects

Movie

or

Book

Fields

* Title
* Genre
* Author/Director
* Poster
* Description
* Rating
* Release Year
* Tags
* Status

Validation

* Required fields
* Duplicate prevention
* Rating 1–5
* Valid year

---

## Edit Item

Users can modify every field.

---

## Delete Item

Soft confirmation before deleting.

---

## Search

Search should work by

* Title
* Genre
* Description
* Author
* Tags

Results remain separated into

Movies

Books

---

## Filtering

Support

Movie

Book

Genre

Rating

Release Year

Status

Favorite

Filtering should never merge books and movies.

---

## Sorting

Sort independently.

Movies

* Newest
* Oldest
* Rating
* Alphabetical

Books

* Newest
* Oldest
* Rating
* Alphabetical

---

## Pagination

Independent pagination.

Movies pagination must not affect Books.

Books pagination must not affect Movies.

---

