# 18. Database Design

## Users

| Field     | Type     |
| --------- | -------- |
| _id       | ObjectId |
| name      | String   |
| email     | String   |
| password  | String   |
| avatar    | String   |
| createdAt | Date     |

---

## LibraryItems

| Field            | Type       |
| ---------------- | ---------- |
| _id              | ObjectId   |
| type             | Movie/Book |
| title            | String     |
| genre            | String     |
| authorOrDirector | String     |
| description      | String     |
| poster           | String     |
| rating           | Number     |
| releaseYear      | Number     |
| status           | String     |
| favorite         | Boolean    |
| tags             | Array      |
| createdBy        | ObjectId   |
| createdAt        | Date       |
| updatedAt        | Date       |

