# 22. Future Enhancements

* Cloudinary image uploads
* OCR for book covers
* AI-based recommendations
* Barcode/ISBN scanning
* Movie API integration (TMDB)
* Book API integration (Google Books/Open Library)
* Reading progress tracking
* Watch progress tracking
* Offline mode (PWA)
* Calendar view for recently added items
* Personalized recommendations

---

## Success Criteria

The project will be considered successful if:

* Users can manage personal movie and book collections seamlessly.
* Movies and books remain separated across all pages (Dashboard, Library, Favorites, Search, and Filters).
* The UI is fully responsive with functional Light and Dark themes.
* Favorites update instantly and are accessible through a dedicated page.
* Search, filtering, sorting, and pagination are fast and intuitive.
* The codebase is modular, maintainable, and suitable as a final-year engineering project and portfolio showcase.
